The '''List of monarchs of Sarta''' covers the monarchs of Sarta from the unification of 1197 onward. The monarchy followed hereditary primogeniture within the [[House of Fuertelon]], beginning with [[Ramiro I of Fuertelon|Ramiro I]] of Fuertelon. The list below records the known dynastic sequence of the Sartan kingdom, including [[Carlos I of Sarta]], [[Maria I of Sarta]], and [[Alfonso II of Sarta]].

